            "level": "H0",
            "text": "$\\delta$ 可以依赖哪些量？",
            "cost": 0
          },
          {
            "level": "H1",
            "text": "定义里 $\\delta$ 在 $x$ 之前取定，只能依赖 $\\varepsilon$。",
            "cost": 0
          },
          {
            "level": "H2",
            "text": "从上一行的不等式反推：$|x-1|$ 小到什么程度就够了？",
            "cost": 0.5
          },
          {
            "level": "H3",
            "text": "只要 $2|x-1|<\\varepsilon$，即 $|x-1|<\\frac{\\varepsilon}{2}$。",
            "cost": 1
          },
          {
            "level": "H4",
            "text": "取 $\\delta=\\frac{\\varepsilon}{2}$。下一行：对 $0<|x-1|<\\delta$ 写出结论。",
            "cost": 1,
            "handsBack": true
          }
        ]
      },
