        "publishable": true,
        "text": "任取 $\\varepsilon>0$，取 $\\delta=\\frac{\\varepsilon}{2}$。当 $0<|x-1|<\\delta$ 时，$|(2x+1)-3|=2|x-1|<2\\delta=\\varepsilon$。故 $\\lim_{x\\to1}(2x+1)=3$。"
